# These were hard-coded directly in settings.py before (a real Gmail account
# + App Password sitting in source that's pushed to a public repo). Moved
# here so the code itself has no secrets in it. Set the same two lines in the
# production server's .env or outgoing email (invites, OTPs, etc.) will stop
# working after this deploy.
